{"4529080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hex Machina", "steam_appid": 4529080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex Machina is a roguelite autobattler game in which you play as a character who has washed ashore on Hexagonia, a mysterious island that is the source of powerful magic. To escape, you’ll need to reactivate ancient machines, the Hexabots, which will fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of Hexagonia, win battles, find equipment suited to your strategy, and tip the scales in your favor with tactical maneuvers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble your Hexabots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find plenty of items and pieces of equipment on the island. However, you’ll need to find the right synergy between your machines to win the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/f2cad10b5dcec29162fc910422474df6.poster.avif?t=1781078050\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/f2cad10b5dcec29162fc910422474df6.webm?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/f2cad10b5dcec29162fc910422474df6.mp4?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the secrets of Hexagonia Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the island allows you to fight your enemies, but that’s not all. Many secrets on the island will let you upgrade your equipment and boost the power of your Hexabots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/9e03da5694fd19206fb50de89dbc37c1.poster.avif?t=1781078050\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/9e03da5694fd19206fb50de89dbc37c1.webm?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/9e03da5694fd19206fb50de89dbc37c1.mp4?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Position your robots and activate their powers to defeat your enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory also depends on tactics: Strategic placement, the use of activation gems, and tactical maneuvers in combat will secure your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/320c7ef0f5b3dbf5196222f29ff7b3e6.poster.avif?t=1781078050\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/320c7ef0f5b3dbf5196222f29ff7b3e6.webm?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/320c7ef0f5b3dbf5196222f29ff7b3e6.mp4?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex Machina is a roguelite autobattler game in which you play as a character who has washed ashore on Hexagonia, a mysterious island that is the source of powerful magic. To escape, you’ll need to reactivate ancient machines, the Hexabots, which will fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of Hexagonia, win battles, find equipment suited to your strategy, and tip the scales in your favor with tactical maneuvers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble your Hexabots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll find plenty of items and pieces of equipment on the island. However, you’ll need to find the right synergy between your machines to win the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/f2cad10b5dcec29162fc910422474df6.poster.avif?t=1781078050\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/f2cad10b5dcec29162fc910422474df6.webm?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/f2cad10b5dcec29162fc910422474df6.mp4?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the secrets of Hexagonia Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the island allows you to fight your enemies, but that’s not all. Many secrets on the island will let you upgrade your equipment and boost the power of your Hexabots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/9e03da5694fd19206fb50de89dbc37c1.poster.avif?t=1781078050\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/9e03da5694fd19206fb50de89dbc37c1.webm?t=1781078050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529080/extras/9e03da5694fd19206fb50de89dbc37c